---
---

<section id="stack" class="py-20 border-b border-slate-800/60 bg-[#080C14]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
      <div class="inline-block text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wider text-teal-400 uppercase bg-teal-950/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-md border border-teal-800/40 mb-3">
        Systems Engineering
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        Built with Institutional Rigor
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Trading algorithms are only as robust as the systems running them. We apply strict software engineering disciplines to financial data infrastructure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Col 1 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 mb-2">01 / Foundation</div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white font-mono">Type Safety</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Zero untyped code. Full strict typing across Python 3.12+, Pydantic v2 schemas, and immutable dataclasses with static verification in CI.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 mb-2">02 / Storage</div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white font-mono">Parquet & Arrow</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Columnar partitioned storage with Snappy/ZSTD compression. Zero row-by-row parsing overhead; sub-millisecond scans over multi-gigabyte tick datasets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 mb-2">03 / Governance</div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white font-mono">ADR Architecture</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Every contract evolution, fee formula, and gap remediation requires an Architectural Decision Record (ADR) reviewed against frozen baseline specs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 mb-2">04 / Testing</div>
        <h4 class="text-base font-semibold text-white font-mono">Golden E2E Gates</h4>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Adversarial suites (A1–A9), Golden Bybit BTCUSDT end-to-end integration tests, and ledger balance conservation checked on every PR.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
